# Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from your Supabase project settings: https://app.supabase.com

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# NOTE: The diary cloud login email/password are HARDCODED in
# src/lib/hardcodedAuth.ts (SUPABASE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL / SUPABASE_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD)
# and must match a user in Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Users.
# No env vars are needed for them.
